{
  "name": "01 - Email Triage Pipeline",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "minutes",
              "interval": 5
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "imap-scheduler",
      "name": "IMAP Scheduler",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [100, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "brand": "gmail",
        "credentials": {
          "imap": {
            "id": "imap-gmail-cred",
            "name": "Gmail IMAP"
          }
        },
        "action": "read",
        "block": false,
        "format": "resolved",
        "emailProperties": ["body", "sender", "subject", "headers", "messageId"]
      },
      "id": "imap-read-node",
      "name": "Read Gmail Emails",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailReadImap",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [300, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "imap": {
          "id": "imap-gmail-cred",
          "name": "Gmail IMAP"
        }
      },
      "continueOnFail": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "http://api:8000/context",
        "options": {
          "headers": {
            "entries": [
              {
                "name": "X-API-Key",
                "value": "{{ $env.API_KEY }}"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "fetch-context-http",
      "name": "Fetch BusinessContext",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [500, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const items = $input.all();\nconst context = items[0].json;\n\nreturn items.map(item => {\n  const email = item.json;\n  return {\n    json: {\n      body: email.body || email.text || '',\n      sender: email.sender || email.from || '',\n      sender_name: email.senderName || email.fromName || '',\n      subject: email.subject || '',\n      message_id: email.messageId || email.id || '',\n      context: context\n    }\n  };\n});"
      },
      "id": "normalize-email-data",
      "name": "Normalize Email Data",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [700, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "chat",
        "operation": "complete",
        "model": "gpt-4o",
        "options": {
          "responseFormat": "jsonObject",
          "temperature": 0.2
        },
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "message": "You are an elite executive assistant AI. Your job is to process incoming emails, evaluate their importance based on a dynamic Business Context, extract core metadata, and pre-draft a response.\n\n### Inputs Provided:\n1. {{ $json.body }} - The raw text content of the incoming email.\n2. {{ $json.sender }} - The email address or name of the sender.\n3. {{ $json.context }} - A JSON object containing the current business goals, keywords, and drafting rules.\n\n### Processing Instructions:\n1. Compare the email body against the \"core_focus\" and \"target_keywords\" in the Business Context.\n2. Determine if this email represents an immediate business opportunity, a critical operational threat, an essential client request, or an upcoming constraint. If yes, set \"is_flagged\" to true.\n3. If the email is a routine inquiry or task, draft a high-quality response matching the \"auto_draft_tone\" provided in the context.\n4. If the email is clear spam or completely irrelevant, set \"is_flagged\" to false, leave the summary blank, and do not draft a response.\n\n### Output Format:\nYou must return valid JSON ONLY.\n{\n  \"is_flagged\": boolean,\n  \"flag_reason\": \"String explaining why it was flagged, or null\",\n  \"summary\": \"A 1-2 sentence summary of the sender's core intent\",\n  \"suggested_action\": \"The immediate next action required\",\n  \"draft_response\": \"The complete draft reply text, or null\"\n}",
              "role": "system"
            },
            {
              "message": "From: {{ $json.sender }}\nSubject: {{ $json.subject }}\n\n{{ $json.body }}",
              "role": "user"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "llm-triage-engine",
      "name": "LLM Triage Engine",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [900, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const items = $input.all();\nconst emailData = items[1].json;\nconst triageResult = items[0].json;\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    message_id: emailData.message_id,\n    sender: emailData.sender,\n    sender_name: emailData.sender_name,\n    subject: emailData.subject,\n    body: emailData.body,\n    body_preview: (emailData.body || '').substring(0, 200),\n    summary: triageResult.summary || null,\n    flag_reason: triageResult.flag_reason || null,\n    suggested_action: triageResult.suggested_action || null,\n    draft_response: triageResult.draft_response || null,\n    is_flagged: triageResult.is_flagged || false,\n    is_read: true\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "merge-email-triage",
      "name": "Merge Email + Triage",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1100, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "http://api:8000/correspondence/flagged",
        "method": "POST",
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "message_id",
              "value": "{{ $json.message_id }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "sender",
              "value": "{{ $json.sender }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "sender_name",
              "value": "{{ $json.sender_name }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "subject",
              "value": "{{ $json.subject }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "body",
              "value": "{{ $json.body }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "body_preview",
              "value": "{{ $json.body_preview }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "summary",
              "value": "{{ $json.summary }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "flag_reason",
              "value": "{{ $json.flag_reason }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "suggested_action",
              "value": "{{ $json.suggested_action }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "draft_response",
              "value": "{{ $json.draft_response }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "is_flagged",
              "value": "{{ $json.is_flagged }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "is_read",
              "value": "{{ $json.is_read }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "headers": {
            "entries": [
              {
                "name": "X-API-Key",
                "value": "{{ $env.API_KEY }}"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "save-flagged-email",
      "name": "Save to NocoDB",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1300, 300]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "IMAP Scheduler": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Read Gmail Emails",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Read Gmail Emails": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Fetch BusinessContext",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Fetch BusinessContext": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Normalize Email Data",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Normalize Email Data": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "LLM Triage Engine",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "LLM Triage Engine": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Merge Email + Triage",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Merge Email + Triage": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Save to NocoDB",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "staticData": null,
  "tags": ["triage", "email", "llm"],
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetup": [
      {
        "name": "imap-gmail-cred",
        "type": "imap",
        "label": "Gmail IMAP"
      }
    ]
  }
}